type: software
title: "Rela²x"
abstract: >-
  Analytic and automatic NMR relaxation theory: a Python package that symbolically builds the
  Liouville-space Hamiltonian, relaxation, and Liouvillian superoperators governing high-field
  liquid-state NMR spin dynamics for arbitrary small spin systems.
